WEBVTT

NOTE
Meeting: New product review (compact reducer RG-40), 8th
Date: 2026-10-05 15:00-15:40
Place: Zoom
Participants: Yumi Shiiba, Daisuke Tsuge, Takuya Ashikari, Takashi Togano, Koji Shioiri (Hamanasu Die Co.)
Recorded by: Zoom transcription

1
00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:11.800
Yumi Shiiba: Hello, everyone. Let's start the 8th RG-40 review. Today: the results of prototype 2, the production die, and the trade show.

2
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:27.450
Daisuke Tsuge: The noise test of prototype 2 measured 57 decibels against the target of 55. I think the gear tooth contact is the cause.

3
00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:36.900
Yumi Shiiba: 2 decibels. Do you have a fix?

4
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:52.100
Daisuke Tsuge: Tooth profile correction should bring it down 1.5 to 2 decibels. I'll issue the corrected drawing tomorrow.

5
00:00:52.800 --> 00:01:03.500
Yumi Shiiba: Please do. Then we decide that prototype 3 uses the corrected tooth profile.

6
00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:20.700
Koji Shioiri: About the die. We can deliver the production die 8 weeks after the prototype 3 drawing is fixed.

7
00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:33.000
Takashi Togano: Is the quote you gave us last time still valid?

8
00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:45.200
Koji Shioiri: Material prices went up a little, so I'll send a new quote. By this Friday.

9
00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:58.400
Takashi Togano: Thank you. When it arrives, I'll take the internal approval through. I want it in time for the management meeting on the 10th of next month.

10
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:15.300
Takuya Ashikari: The trade show. Sales would like to show it as a reference exhibit at the industrial equipment show in November.

11
00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:28.600
Yumi Shiiba: It depends on whether prototype 3 is ready. Let's decide by next time whether we exhibit.

12
00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:41.000
Takuya Ashikari: If we do, I think someone in sales should prepare the panel text as soon as possible.

13
00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:50.200
Yumi Shiiba: Yes. Please decide that within sales.

14
00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:58.900
Yumi Shiiba: That's all for today. Thank you.
